{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act22side_level_act22side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act22side",
  "stageId": "act22side_05",
  "title": "祝福的歌謠",
  "storyCode": "FC-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "db138b66c56c03d008e428b46c78c3ef254bdce1318c2571039db0231d873cce",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "葦草，你那邊固定了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "嗯，沒問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "咻——好了，這是最後一頂帳篷啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "哎呀，你們的力氣可真大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "對了，你們是不是要走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "是呀，我和陳陳要調查的就是那些被法術控制的“鬼魂士兵”，這邊的事情結束之後，我們還有其他的任務。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "而且這裡已經是特倫特郡轄區的邊界，應該不會再有駐軍找你們麻煩啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "......唉，要是我們把秩序維持得更好一些，這麼多混亂和冤枉的事情，就都不會發生了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "啊，你在說什麼呢？要不是因為你們，我們都不知道能不能活到現在呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "如果這是在我家，今晚我就要請你們喝接骨木酒，給你們送行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "不過我們現在手裡的物資，大半還都是你們從......從那個“羅德島”帶過來的，哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "我們給那個羅德島寄信，你們能收到嗎？到時候大家找到地方落腳了，跟你們說一聲，你們要是再路過這附近，可以來做客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "欸，應該可以吧？要是維多利亞的紛爭結束，然後陳陳也見到了那個人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "......你呢，葦草？接下來你要去哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "我......應該會確認所有人都安頓好了，再去做自己的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "就算離開了石高原野，擺脫了罪名，沒有了熄火鐘的管制......塔拉人也依然生活在一片泥濘的土地上，他們還是會寸步難行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "我覺得，我應該再幫他們想想辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "塔拉和維多利亞的語言，我都會說，之後如果進入城市，遇到各種不同的人，我都可以交涉......會比其他人方便一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "啊，對了，今天你去找羅德島的安全屋時，有沒有什麼人跟蹤你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "......應該沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "沒關係，我記得你的提醒。如果那些士兵是衝著我來的......我不怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "還有......謝謝你的好心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "你說，到時候葦草肯不肯把帳篷賣一頂給我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "那可是城裡工廠做出來的帆布，暴雨澆上半個月也不會漏水，正適合拿來改造我的小拖車。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "她心地很善良，你也不會昧著良心出價。我猜，你們的交易應該是能談成的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "哈，我開玩笑的，我哪裡有錢買這麼好的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "不過誰能想到呢，前幾天我們還為怎麼活命發愁，現在卻能睡進工廠做出來的結實帳篷，夜裡也能生火了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "嗯，她們很有本事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "也懂礦石病的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "（口哨聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "（不連貫的口哨旋律）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "籠罩溪谷的霧靄啊......♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "......將她遠行的身影遮蔽......♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "還是很好聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "......那些追過我的人裡，現在應該只有你還記得我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "別這麼說......大家肯定都記得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "礦石病又不是你的錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "（有點跑調的口哨音）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "那小子，塞爾蒙她哥，死了。說不定我們當時幫過的那一隊深池都死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "我們白忙了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "還好......至少你還活著，失蹤了那麼久之後，你還活著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "我看到葦草給你塞藥了，礦石病是不是其實能治好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "不，她們都說是治不好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "但是，請不要埋怨那些深池的士兵。我幫他們躲進工廠的運輸車，傷口滲入了源石粗礦的碎屑......這也不是他們的錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "沒有，我哪有埋怨呀，我只是覺得心裡難受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "你們都相信深池，可我不敢信。深池是比我們厲害，還有武器，但我們都親眼看到了，最後那隊人被打得有多慘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "深池會對塔拉人好，幫塔拉人出口氣，可之後呢？我想不出來......我就只記得那天車廂上的血。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "塞爾蒙到現在還是想去找深池，去跟維多利亞人打仗，我都勸不住她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "你說，那天她跟葦草聊了那麼久，葦草難道沒給她講清楚道理嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "可是我覺得，塞爾蒙那麼做，不壞。她那樣的人，能為其他塔拉人做很多事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "你還記得嗎？我感染之後不久，整個感染者街區的人一起被驅趕出了小鎮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "後來，被驅趕出來的鎮民裡更健壯有力的那些，搶走了大家身上所有的物資，留下了羸弱的老人與孩子，還有我這樣在虛弱期的病人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "......你該早點說。說出來至少心裡沒那麼難過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "但其實，我都快記不清了。我都想不起來，為什麼沒人反抗，也沒人保護其他人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "以前我一直想，生活就是這樣子，手裡捧著的無論是什麼，只要肚子餓了，閉上眼睛就咽下去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "莉莎死在礦井底下，柯蘿達也死在礦井底下，你們家難道有人抱怨過礦場的工作嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "呃......我說不好，也許是不能抱怨誰，但至少大姐和二姐死的時候，我自己挺難過的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "我想找人說說這些，但是又黑又悶的礦井底下，沒人聽我說。我跑出來兜售些雜貨，結果每家人都有自己的難處，也沒人聽我說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "好吧，現在說也不遲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "是啊，現在也不遲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "我們撿的這些木柴，應該夠燒一晚上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "（口哨聲）......那就走吧，太陽落山了，等會你該看不清路了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "哎，鍋子咕嘟咕嘟冒泡啦，現在我能吃一口嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "別心急，你這傻子！難道你家裡從來沒讓你燒過飯嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "去帳篷裡等著，等會肉煮好了我端過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "她看起來心情好了不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "嗯......但她一定還是很傷心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "至少，讓她死了去深池的心，是件好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "......你一直知道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我相信有你在的話，他們不會踏錯路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......雖然你很難一直陪著這些人走，德拉克。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我不會認錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "別瞎說，費加爾，去年的戲裡，你演的是蓋爾王的戰士。你演他重傷倒下三次又爬起來三次，結果把自己的胳膊和腿都摔青啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "那我今年就演他刀槍不入好啦。年年都演蓋爾王戰敗，演加斯特里爾死在王城腳下，除了戲服上能綴點花，就再沒新鮮的東西啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "嘿，塞爾蒙，過來，坐過來。我看今年你可以扮演蓋爾王手下第一大將軍。雖然年紀小了點，但論氣勢，還真沒人能蓋過你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "哈？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "你就是饞她端來的鍋子，才對她胡說。你看她自己都不願意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "不是，你們在說什麼啊？我不認識這人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "欸，你家那邊到了夏天，不演那幾齣固定的劇目嗎？我們在商量怎麼分角色呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "唔......演到最後，一個自稱河神的傢伙會站起來往觀眾身上灑水，那個活動？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "......見過，沒興趣參加，除非讓我演河神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "那是河神在為死掉的戰士哀悼呀。那段台詞可比其他角色的都難記。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "但也說不定我們還沒建好房子，今年夏天就過去了。那你就能準備到明年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "......是啊，說不定呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "看你這表情，你還想去找深池？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "當然。你以為我跟你們一樣，說放棄就放棄了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "這是那天我跟葦草聊過之後得出的結論。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "我還是相信，深池的夢想是可以實現的，也必須要有人去實現。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "......你想從我這裡打聽什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我沒什麼可過問。你做的事，我看在眼裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我信我親眼所見得出的判斷，也信羅德島的判斷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "但現在大多數維多利亞人眼裡，活著的德拉克，只有一條。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......深池的紅龍，塔拉的君主後裔。那一條紅龍就足夠讓公爵們各懷鬼胎，貴族們人心惶惶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你一定為難。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "那......她知道我的身份嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "風笛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "她其實很聰明，心也很細。但很多事，尤其是和她認同的朋友有關的事情，她不願意往壞處想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "這樣同行下去的話，她遲早得面對，你也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "......你要勸我儘早離開嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "做過的事情就是做過。需要你擔負的責任，你逃不掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "但我覺得，對一些人而言，你是不是德拉克沒那麼重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗啞的歌聲",
      "text": "細小的溪流梳過茵茵原野♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗啞的歌聲",
      "text": "我們為缺席的人舉杯♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "歌聲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "......應該是費加爾在唱歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "塔拉語？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "嗯，聽起來，是一首關於酒和夏日原野的歌。我沒聽過......但很好聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拍打著翅膀醒來吧，水畔的羽獸♪\n把我們聚會的消息隨著水波帶走♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "......他們很開心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "聽得出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "可他們只是有了帳篷和火而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那他們有房舍和田地的時候，應該會更開心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我們進去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "陳陳，你們終於回來啦！快來看奧蘭先生的表演，他能吹響草稈欸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "（尖銳的哨笛音）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "哈哈，可能音不太準，我父親擅長這個，我只是簡單地跟他學了學。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "哼——哼哼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "啊，你們不介意我跟著唱吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "唱呀，這是我們的祝酒歌，我只介意酒瓶裡沒有酒，哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "那，歌詞是什麼？我用維多利亞語唱行不行？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "唔......要不還是換個人來，你先聽著好啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "維恩，你來唱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“這土地總是結出眼淚，我們卻飲下往昔的露與火。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "曲折小徑開滿玫瑰與風鈴草♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "你跑調啦！唱功還得再練練！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "閉嘴！你自己也沒好到哪去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "（刺耳的哨笛聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "呃......求你，別弄出噪音了，哪有你這樣跟人吵架的呀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "哎，也別再拿石頭扔來扔去了！要是真沒躲過怎麼辦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "哇，好香的麵包......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的流民",
      "text": "可以分你一半哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "多謝啦！來，陳陳，你咬一口這個麵包，就一口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "是不是很香？我在想，他們是拿什麼草做的香料呀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "嗯......吃不出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "欸，回炎國這麼久，你的口味是更挑剔了，還是變遲鈍了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你覺得呢？其實龍門人夏天喝茶要用二十四種藥材熬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "真的？......你又在開玩笑啦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......你覺得高興嗎，葦草？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "他們的生活原本可以是這樣的，當然，比這更好一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你把生活還給了他們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "葦草，你是會講塔拉語的，別找藉口，唱呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "......欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "（俏皮的哨笛聲）唱呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葦草",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特別行動隊士兵",
      "text": "載具在泥濘地帶會留下明顯的車轍，我們要繞路嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "text": "不必了，直接向目標地點前進吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "好呀，還有你呢，莫蘭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "風笛",
      "text": "莫蘭小姐，幹嘛坐在那麼遠的地方呀？葦草都講了那麼多次沒關係了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "是啊，“卡邁河谷的吟遊詩人”......唱吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫蘭",
      "text": "籠罩溪谷的霧靄啊......將她遠行的身影遮蔽......♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "哎呀，我是不是在好些年前聽過這個歌聲？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "你肯定聽過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "對啦，我記得那時候我牽著我妹妹，她還沒病到走不動路呢。我們在石橋上站著，聽了好一會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "唉，卡邁河流得那麼遠，別處應該也有一樣的橋吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "text": "先控制平民，但不要讓任何人受傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "text": "我們的調查對象有相當優秀的軍事素養，儘量避免正面交戰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "text": "塞爾蒙，你看，我這個招架姿勢怎麼樣？跟你學的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞爾蒙",
      "text": "不怎麼樣。你以後也就趕趕羽獸，學這個幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "text": "不要和任何人溝通，一句話也不要說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "text": "後續的事情交給我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "別忘了，我們要在天亮前離開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "text": "架好弩箭，準備煙霧彈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "唉......我得出去緩口氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "嗯？這個時間，起霧了......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維恩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你們，\n是、\n是什麼時候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍爾",
      "text": "晚上好，先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
